    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d374">

                <pb facs="0862" n="814" sameAs="frus:frus1868p1/pg814"/>

                <head>Mr. Van Valkenburgh to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 91.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Yokohama,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1868-09-09"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >September</hi> 9, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> Our consul at Osaka and Hiogo having
                    reported to me that the Japanese authorities at those places had prohibited the
                    transportation of rice to other opened ports in Japan, I immediately addressed a
                    letter on the subject to Higashi Kuze Chinjio, a copy of which I herewith
                    transmit, inclosure No. 1.</p>
                <p>This matter was then promptly discussed between the foreign representatives and
                    Higashi Kuze, and I now transmit No. 2, copy of an arrangement which was
                    unanimously accepted by the foreign representatives.</p>
                <p>Copies of this arrangement have been forwarded to the consuls of the United
                    States in this country.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, very respectfully, your most obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>R. B. VAN VALKENBURGH.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington, D. C.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d374-a1.xml" xpointer="d374-a1"/>
            </div>
